.TH TUNED-RS 8 "July 2026" "tuned-rs 0.2.3" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
tuned-rs \- dynamic system tuning daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tuned-rs
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tuned-rs
is a Rust implementation of the TuneD daemon. It loads TuneD-compatible
profiles, applies system tuning settings, exposes the TuneD D-Bus interfaces,
and restores recorded settings when configured to roll back.
.PP
The daemon is normally managed through
.BR systemctl (1)
using the
.B tuned-rs.service
unit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/tuned/tuned-main.conf
Main daemon configuration.
.TP
.I /etc/tuned/profiles
Locally administered TuneD profiles.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/tuned/profiles
Package-provided TuneD profiles.
.TP
.I /var/lib/tuned-rs/rollback.json
Persisted rollback state.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TUNED_RS_PROFILE_DIRS
Comma-separated profile search path.
.TP
.B TUNED_RS_ROOT
Prefix applied to configuration and state paths for testing.
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Logging filter, such as
.BR tuned_rs=debug .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tuned-rs-ppd (8),
.BR tuned-adm (8),
.BR systemctl (1)
